From f7bb1a1130991e7440077f2244a210c41ef31ec7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:35:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 46/58] topk: diagnostic-only build defines and qualification
 test cells

Compile-time defines (default 0, device code unchanged by default) for the
delayed-publication stress, the pre-repair control and a forced-fault cell;
test cells for the OFF-arm controls, the QSA_SORT contract, FULL_K attribution
on the Marlin MoE GEMM and legacy-tail repeated-row membership.
---
